{
  "longTitle": "A Bill to implement the Nairobi International Convention on the Removal of Wrecks 2007.",
  "summary": "<p>The Nairobi International Convention for the Removal of Wrecks (ICRW) was adopted by the International Maritime Organisation in May 2007. </p><p>The Bill provides measures to enable the United Kingdom to ratify and implement the ICRW in the United Kingdom&rsquo;s domestic law by the insertion of new sections and a Schedule into the Merchant Shipping Act 1995.</p>",
